WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590 line:78% align:center
I'm a senior cybersecurity
consultant with EY.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:09.350 line:78% align:center
Every single company in the world has
technology, and cybersecurity is

00:00:09.370 --> 00:00:13.780 line:78% align:center
essentially the securing and
protection of that technology.

00:00:14.130 --> 00:00:17.590 line:78% align:center
Personal information like people's names,
social security numbers, their

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.240 line:78% align:center
credit card information, their
medical information.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.000 line:78% align:center
So we really wanna make sure that
it's being secured.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.310 line:78% align:center
Consulting is when you are asked to help out
and solve a problem that you're

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:31.830 line:78% align:center
not directly responsible for.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:37.330 line:78% align:center
In the corporate world, companies will hire
us as consultants to give them

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.360 line:78% align:center
information on how to do things
in the best way.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:45.420 line:78% align:center
Now you understand cybersecurity, and
you understand consulting.

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:47.220 line:78% align:center
So what is a cybersecurity consultant?

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:51.010 line:78% align:center
It's someone who is brought on to help a
company with their cybersecurity

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:53.180 line:78% align:center
problems. So that's what I do.

00:00:53.190 --> 00:00:54.520 line:78% align:center
I'm brought in to help with that.
